          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, column III (left side)",
          "value": "<p></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Ya\u02bfq\u016bb the dyer 3 Simon 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">b. Nissim 4 Ab\u016b Shaykha 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the man from the \u1e24ij\u0101z 3 Umm Y\u016bsuf 3</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Umm Mi[r]yam 2 the fortune teller? (al-mun\u0101dal\u012b) 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Symeon 4 the female washer of the dead for the R\u016bm 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">[R]ebecca 4 Umm Matatya 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">[an o]rphan from R\u016bm 2 b. Y\u016bsuf 10 the glassmaker 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the daughter of \u1e24ash\u012bka 5 the acquaintance of</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Abu\u02bel-Mun\u0101 8 Shemarya 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Sal\u0101ma 4 Umm \u1e92ar\u012bfa 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The man from Qalah\u0101 3 Ma\u02bfl\u0101\u02be5</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the worker and/or dealer in lead 5 the wife of the seller of fuqq\u0101\u02bf (honey sherbet) 4 [[3]]</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Zuhayr and his mother-in-law 6 the man from Ba\u02bfalbek 6</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">b. al-Qu\u1e0d\u0101\u02bf\u012b (the son of the healer of stomach ailments) 6 the teacher from Acre 6</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u1e62adaqa the beadle 10 the son of the woman from Palestine 3</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Furayj the beadle 14 b. al-J\u0101zif\u012bn\u012b 8</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">b. Abu\u02bel-\u1e24ayy [...] the preparer of vinegar sauce or other appetizers (al-k\u0101mukh\u012b) and his father-in-law 11</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the orphans of U[mm Ka]th\u012br 4 Sulaym\u0101n 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the wife of \u1e24\u016br\u0101ra 3 Umm Ibrah\u012bm 3</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Umm Ka\u1e25l\u0101\u02be 5 the supervisor from Tiberias 6</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the Maghrebi woman 2 Sab\u012b\u02bf 5</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
